# the unversioned symlinks of the libraries shipped by this package
# exist, but in the mfront-dev and mtest-dev packages, whose semantic
# names lintian cannot relate to the library SONAMEs (the conventional
# names would be libabaqusinterface5.2.0-dev, etc.); the full version
# as SONAME is discussed as an upstream issue in GitHub issue #1466
lacks-unversioned-link-to-shared-library usr/lib/*
package-name-doesnt-match-sonames *
# pure C++ libraries which do not reference any libc symbol directly:
# the libc DT_NEEDED entry is dropped by the linker (--as-needed), as
# their symbols are provided by libstdc++ itself
library-not-linked-against-libc usr/lib/*/libMFrontGenericParallelRuntime.so.*
library-not-linked-against-libc usr/lib/*/libTFELMathCubicSpline.so.*
